ithout callback?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">I know i am asking a lot of beginner questions but I hope to learn quickly. Thank you!</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div></div></div>"
